  "question": {
    "text": "If the value of Avogadro number is <math><mn>6.023</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>23</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> and the value of Boltzmann constant is <math><mn>1.380</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>23</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> , then the number of significant digits in the calculated value of the universal gas constant is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>K</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>R</mtext><msub><mtext>N</mtext><mtext>A</mtext></msub></mfrac></math></p><p><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8756;</mo> <mo>R</mo> <mo>=</mo> <msub> <mtext>k.N</mtext> <mtext>A</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </math></p><p><math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>6.023</mtext> <mo>&#215;</mo> <msup> <mtext>10</mtext> <mtext>23</mtext> </msup> <mo>&#215;</mo> <mtext>1.380</mtext> <mo>&#215;</mo> <msup> <mtext>10</mtext> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </msup> <msup> <mo>J. mol</mo> <mn>-1</mn> </msup> <msup> <mtext>k</mtext> <mn>-1</mn> </msup> </mrow> </math></p><p>There are 4 significant figures in each term.</p><p>Hence, these be 4 significant figure in R.</p>",
